    "scenesThatPass": [
      "KELLI: Isn't she upstairs writing a card to her sister?\nMELISSA: No, I think that, maybe, Clair's sister might've already picked her up. Remember, this is that... \"occasion for Clair and her sister and her…\nDANA: I'd like to bury the hatchet with my sister... right in her head.",
