      "MEGAN: What?\nKELLI: We're gonna open presents, downstairs.",
      "MEGAN: Start without me.\nKELLI: But, you're going to come down, right?\nMEGAN: I don't know, Kelli! If I do, I do. Just start without me.\nLAUREN: I realize you're an only child, so let me explain... Christmas is just Darwin. The weak get eaten.",
      "MELISSA: Did Eve have someplace to be?\nDANA: The Island of Misfit Toys."
    ]
